cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or results, please cite the paper."
type: software
title: "S4DR: Structural Candidate Library for Daily Forecasting — Public Reproducibility Repository"
abstract: >
  Public reproducibility code for 'Specialization Headroom in Structural Candidate Libraries:
  A Three-Domain Empirical Analysis of Selector Limitations'.
  Contains the 12-candidate structural S4DR model, benchmark runners for M5/LD2011/Wikipedia,
  and pre-computed manuscript data.
repository-code: "https://github.com/DrDavidR/forecast-S4DR"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-13"
keywords:
  - time series forecasting
  - ensemble methods
  - model selection
  - headroom decomposition
  - causal evaluation
  - structural models
  - M5 competition
  - electricity forecasting
  - Wikipedia traffic
